<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/instruments/stamped-skills-assessment> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r6b3f8bdb1def27ad1baf02b9_n8e7e8b1f6ce3416f85184f8692860423b2 .
