<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/con-solidation> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "con/solidation is a command-line tool that produces a Markdown activity report of recent issue and pull-request events across a configured set of GitHub repositories and organizations. It is used by CON to generate regular summaries of activity across the projects it maintains and contributes to, enabling lightweight project-health monitoring without leaving the terminal." .
