<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/mechababs> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "mechababs runs BIDS Apps over many studies on an HPC cluster, with BABS running the jobs. It works on a BIDS study, adding derivatives to it, and records how each one was made inside the study itself: the exact mechababs and BABS versions pinned in a lock, and every orchestration step as a DataLad run record. A superstudy groups many studies so one campaign sweeps them all, which is how mechababs feeds OpenNeuroStudies." .
