<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/doi-10-1162-imag-a-00032> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:rfddbccaa77e19bdbb20eae14_n051caf639a5049729664500ffa94aea1b7 .
