_:r0bd9a8fcf367850c9f23e8a9_n5bd8227d63944063bf259ac8af374e35b9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/description_html> .
