_:r0bd9a8fcf367850c9f23e8a9_n5bd8227d63944063bf259ac8af374e35b9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "<p> <a href=\"https://nwb2bids.readthedocs.io/\">con/nwb2bids</a> reorganizes <a href=\"/projects#neurodata_without_borders__neurophysiology_nwb_n_\">NWB</a> files into a <a href=\"/projects#brain_imaging_data_structure_bids_\">BIDS</a> directory layout, so a dandiset can be read by the tooling that expects BIDS without being converted twice. It is what produces <a href=\"https://github.com/bids-dandisets\">bids-dandisets</a>, the GitHub organization holding individual DANDI dandisets in BIDS form. </p>" .
