_:r12432604c57751954ac60b49_ndc361f5a3e764f48a787cb65f171da18b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "The DICOM working group responsible for MR. Where the conventions that make a scanner's output machine-readable are argued out, which is upstream of every BIDS conversion CON does." .
