_:r370e23a5659264acf7103aaf_ncf32f14725104d409c8eb4771543b2c4b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Runs processing pipelines directly on DANDI assets, rather than asking everyone to download them first. Orchestration, a submission client and a public queue; the first campaign puts the AIND ephys pipeline over electrophysiology dandisets." .
