_:r370e23a5659264acf7103aaf_ncf32f14725104d409c8eb4771543b2c4b6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/short_name> .
