_:r3c61c61cf860d1621a01ea45_nc18f3ba0a515466f9dc98d2e44fddd71b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:r3c61c61cf860d1621a01ea45_nc18f3ba0a515466f9dc98d2e44fddd71b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "BIDS Guru and Jedi Master of all the *Preps. Software developer at Stanford's <a href=\"https://poldracklab.stanford.edu/\">Poldrack Lab</a> and research affiliate of the MIT McGovern Institute for Brain Research. Core developer of <a href=\"https://fmriprep.org/\">fMRIPrep</a> and other <a href=\"https://www.nipreps.org/\">NiPreps</a>, long-standing <a href=\"https://bids.neuroimaging.io/\">BIDS</a> maintainer, and one of the pillars of the neuroimaging Python ecosystem (<a href=\"https://nipy.org/nibabel/\">NiBabel</a>, <a href=\"https://nipype.readthedocs.io/\">Nipype</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/poldracklab/fitlins\">FitLins</a>)." .
