_:r4fb0079170ac239536c79162_n336fa3a82fd54c8cb9d0a6ea948987bfb11 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "<p> <a href=\"https://www.nwb.org/\">NWB:N</a> is a data standard for neurophysiology, providing neuroscientists with a common standard to share, archive, use, and build analysis tools for neurophysiology data. It is a standard supported by <a href=\"#bids\">BIDS</a> and the <a href=\"#dandi\">DANDI archive</a>. </p> <ul> <li> <a href=\"https://github.com/con/nwb2bids\">con/nwb2bids</a>: a CON tool to reorganize NWB files into a BIDS directory layout, enabling NWB-format datasets to be shared and validated using BIDS conventions. </li> </ul>" .
