_:r51b109b54e0cfc7d58191ce9_n9749884d7446473b865535d83bb61528b7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Platform for publishing, sharing, and processing neurophysiology data supported by the BRAIN Initiative. Provides data upload and distribution with supplementary client tools for data introspection and organization. Compliant with NWB standards." .
