_:r6bdcbdaeb1ce9a4fe3f011db_nc762127172d949748f9bb65e2d7e8faeb11 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> .
