_:r887009906c73792044c3d115_nbe8dfef141c7499089a5ca480f3f66f6b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Annual Review of Neuroscience" .
_:r887009906c73792044c3d115_nbe8dfef141c7499089a5ca480f3f66f6b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> .
