_:r8f475cd3edf78e84f8b2d2b6_n4c029d5f077a4a3397d8ed6b1ead3983b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/description_html> .
