_:r8f475cd3edf78e84f8b2d2b6_n4c029d5f077a4a3397d8ed6b1ead3983b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "<p> <a href=\"https://github.com/con/solidation\">con/solidation</a> is a command-line tool that produces a Markdown activity report of recent issue and pull-request events across a configured set of GitHub repositories and organizations. It is used by CON to generate regular summaries of activity across the projects it maintains and contributes to, enabling lightweight project-health monitoring without leaving the terminal. </p>" .
