_:r9932725f33a24a7f2ee43414_nc07a8209bd484aca9ac10d3a8b30b688b9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "MyKrok (Ukrainian: \"мій крок\" — \"my step\") is a CLI tool to incrementally back up fitness activities from Strava, including GPS tracks, photos, comments, and kudos. Backups are browsable offline through a built-in web frontend with interactive maps and activity statistics — applying the same git-annex / open-data philosophy of CON's archival tools to personal fitness data. Try the live demo with synthetic data." .
