_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n0c72557c34b64749a4d581eb6d80d542b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> .
_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n0c72557c34b64749a4d581eb6d80d542b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n0c72557c34b64749a4d581eb6d80d542b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "ReproNim/containers is a DataLad dataset providing a ready-to-use \"distribution\" of containerized neuroimaging environments (Singularity images) for reproducible analysis. It collects a curated set of containers — including those used by HeuDiConv and the broader ReproNim ecosystem — and exposes them via the ///repronim/containers DataLad dataset path, making it trivial to pin and share exact software environments alongside data and workflows." .
