_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n0c72557c34b64749a4d581eb6d80d542b8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/short_name> .
_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n0c72557c34b64749a4d581eb6d80d542b8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n0c72557c34b64749a4d581eb6d80d542b8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "ReproNim/containers" .
_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n0c72557c34b64749a4d581eb6d80d542b9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/description_html> .
_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n0c72557c34b64749a4d581eb6d80d542b9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:rb8ce4759263aedf0c619b26c_n0c72557c34b64749a4d581eb6d80d542b9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "<p> <a href=\"https://github.com/ReproNim/containers\">ReproNim/containers</a> is a <a href=\"#datalad\">DataLad</a> dataset providing a ready-to-use \"distribution\" of containerized neuroimaging environments (Singularity images) for reproducible analysis. It collects a curated set of containers — including those used by <a href=\"#heudiconv\">HeuDiConv</a> and the broader <a href=\"http://repronim.org\">ReproNim</a> ecosystem — and exposes them via the <code>///repronim/containers</code> DataLad dataset path, making it trivial to pin and share exact software environments alongside data and workflows. </p>" .
