_:rbb2ab5c95963f401888f8e7d_n5ed37587cd5947e48de2192e1be93ec1b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "https://github.com/con/fscacher" .
_:rbb2ab5c95963f401888f8e7d_n5ed37587cd5947e48de2192e1be93ec1b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> .
_:rbb2ab5c95963f401888f8e7d_n5ed37587cd5947e48de2192e1be93ec1b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:rbb2ab5c95963f401888f8e7d_n5ed37587cd5947e48de2192e1be93ec1b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "con/fscacher is a Python library providing a persistent, file-content-aware memoization cache. Functions decorated with @cache.memoize_path are re-executed only when the fingerprint (timestamps + size) of their file arguments changes — making it easy to cache expensive operations on large file trees without stale results. It is used internally by the DANDI client and other CON tools." .
