_:rc01ee80777c48f29667b7891_n4f95a49ff21745cba9123242cb94b07fb11 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "<p> <a href=\"https://datalad-datasets.github.io/ohbm2020-posters/\">OHBM 2020 posters</a> was a centralized registry of posters and their <a href=\"https://jitsi.org\">Jitsi</a> rooms for <a href=\"https://www.humanbrainmapping.org\">OHBM</a> 2020, the first edition held entirely online. The conference had no working way for an attendee to find a poster and walk up to its author; this gave it one, as a browsable catalogue backed by a <a href=\"/projects#datalad_\">DataLad</a> dataset. Twenty-three people contributed to it in the weeks around the meeting. <a href=\"https://github.com/datalad-datasets/ohbm2020-posters\">Archived</a> since 2022: it did its job for the meeting it was built for. </p>" .
_:rc01ee80777c48f29667b7891_n4f95a49ff21745cba9123242cb94b07fb12 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/code_repository> .
