_:rc04ecfaf1048a46ea9eacd79_nc160109293ef49da8ef3966b90561f88b7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Dr. Wager and his lab have a dedication toward developing analysis methods for functional neuroimaging and sharing ideas, tools, and scientific data with the scientific community and public. At the moment Tor is also leading <a href=\"https://www.dartmouth.edu/dbic/\">Dartmouth Brain Imaging Center (DBIC)</a> where CON pilots various deployments and automations to improve efficiency and reproducibility in the neuroimaging, and the <a href=\"https://www.dartmouth.edu/ccn/\">Center for Cognitive Neuroscience</a>." .
