_:rcb22ac7865255391ba1a6419_nefe06b6c10e74e359dffe4376571b5f2b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "<p> <a href=\"https://github.com/con/tinuous\">con/tinuous</a> is a command for downloading build logs and (for GitHub only) artifacts and release assets for a GitHub repository from GitHub Actions, Travis-CI.com, and/or Appveyor. By downloading them all, and optionally placing them under <a href=\"#datalad\">DataLad</a> control you can establish the backup, distribution, and convenient harmonious access to all those artifacts. </p>" .
_:rcb22ac7865255391ba1a6419_nefe06b6c10e74e359dffe4376571b5f2b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> .
