_:rd4ac77d1e87d15badc19433e_nf250a08044ac43a396cbb402b6679be0b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Masters student in Psychology / Cognitive Neuroscience at the University of Magdeburg. Oliver started his enthusiasm for open science as an intern at Dartmouth College where he enjoyed a summer full of fMRI data analysis. His current goal is to provide his University with a fully reproducible Masters thesis. Naturally, the perfect way to do it is by using - and contributing to - open software frameworks." .
